{
  "id": "noto-bond",
  "name": "Noto Bond (CSD notary)",
  "tagline": "Private bond — only the notary and counterparties see the amounts",
  "concept": "A Noto bond issued by a Central Securities Depository (the notary). Balances are private notes: the notary and the counterparties of each transfer see the amounts, while other consortium members see only that transactions happened — never how much. The public sees nothing.",
